   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BGD RESP, l&#xe5;n II/V&#xe4;gar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R02 BGD RESP loan II road - BGD Roadinv. RESP loan II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna insats avser en bist&#xe5;ndskredit, via AB SEK som agent, p&#xe5; 35 000 000 SEK till The Governmet of the People&#xb4;s Republic of Bangladesh ifr&#xe5;n The Government of Sweden representerad av Sida. Den f&#xf6;rst l&#xe5;neutbetalningen skedde i juni 1999 och den sista utbetalningen skedde i augusti 2000. Det p&#xe5;g&#xe5;r f n en &#xe5;terbetalning av l&#xe5;net och som prelimin&#xe4;rt ber&#xe4;knas vara slutamorterad 2013-06-30.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is a Development loan, by AB SEK as agent, at 35 000 000 SEK to The Government of the People&#xb4;s Republic of Bangladesh from The Government of Sweden represented by Sida. The first disbursement was made in June 1999 and the final disbursement was made in August 2000. The repayment of the loan is ongoing and the final repayment is estimated to 2013-06-30.</narrative>
  </description>
